"should not be changed. For :ref:`Single Copter and Coax Copter "
"<singlecopter-and-coaxcopter>` the :ref:`FRAME_CLASS <FRAME_CLASS>` "
"parameter should be set directly from the Full Parameter List until `this"
" issue <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/issues/1552>`__ is "
"resolved."
msgstr ""

